---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Lightbox from '../components/Lightbox.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Our Boat — Jackie B III Going Loopy"
  description="The story behind the Jackie B III, a Cruisers 455 Express Motor Yacht."
>
  <div class="max-w-[720px] mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <h1 class="font-inter font-bold text-[28px] text-ink leading-[1.2] mb-8">Our Boat</h1>

    <figure class="page-photo mb-8">
      <img
        class="zoomable-img"
        src="https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgmE35YuSQGd953Vz9ittR4Jv8hqef4Kr7K1I3WhDUI6DqFrrO9J0eA3HqCl7JVkVanvtnQewpq29fth2UL7WmBtGuS-cNlpx_TByLtSLbGf49-7zULUqBBQKztR-BgMm7mhp_Pa24fKQ0m-E110S114eOs7Qnd-DkiDvSWI3ns0qNv7KYu124pft46/w613-h298/02A9C825-544C-4F39-A26F-6A3DD86C821B.jpeg"
        alt="The Jackie B III"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      />
    </figure>

    <div class="font-lora text-[18px] text-ink leading-[1.7]">
      <p class="mb-6">
        The Jackie B III is our 5th boat. She is named after our daughter Jackie who sadly died in a car
        accident while during her second semester at Virginia Tech. This is one of many ways we keep her memory
        alive. The boat is a Cruisers 455 Express Motor Yacht with twin Volvo Penta TAMD-75 diesel 480-HP
        engines. We purchased her in May of 2021 in West Haverstraw, NY. During our maiden voyage we brought her
        500 miles down the Hudson River, out into the Atlantic Ocean, up the Delaware Bay, through the canal to
        the Chesapeake Bay, and up the Potomac River to our home port at Hoffmaster's Marina on the Occoquan
        River. Unfortunately, we had a catastrophic engine failure resulting in a total rebuild of the port
        engine. This required our leaving Northern Virginia earlier than planned and relocating to Norfolk for
        the extensive repairs. She's all back together now, running like a charm.
      </p>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-10">
      <a
        href="/about/"
        class="font-inter text-[14px] text-brass no-underline hover:underline focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brass focus-visible:outline-none"
      >&larr; Back to About</a>
    </p>
  </div>

  <Lightbox />
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-photo {
    border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    border-radius: 8px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .page-photo img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }
</style>
